#: admin/tools.php:696
msgid ""
"This tool finds images that are already in cloud storage but still have "
"local copies on this server, then deletes the local files to free up disk "
"space. Cloud copies are not touched — galleries continue serving from cloud "
"storage."
msgstr "Dette værktøj finder billeder, der allerede ligger i cloud-lager, men stadig har lokale kopier på denne server, og sletter så de lokale filer for at frigøre diskplads. Kopierne i skyen røres ikke — gallerierne leverer fortsat fra cloud-lageret."

#: admin/tools.php:701
msgid ""
"No reclaimable files found. Every image in cloud storage has already had its "
"local copy removed."
msgstr "Ingen filer at frigøre. Alle billeder i cloud-lageret har allerede fået deres lokale kopi fjernet."

#. translators: %s: number of redundant local files
#: admin/tools.php:710
#, php-format
msgid "Found: %s redundant local files"
msgstr "Fundet: %s overflødige lokale filer"

#: admin/tools.php:716
msgid ""
"Each local file is deleted only after its cloud copy is confirmed present "
"and the correct size. Files that can't be verified are skipped."
msgstr "Hver lokal fil slettes først, når det er bekræftet, at kopien i skyen findes og har den rigtige størrelse. Filer, der ikke kan bekræftes, springes over."

#: admin/tools.php:720
msgid "This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Denne handling kan ikke fortrydes."

#: admin/tools.php:721
msgid ""
"Local files will be permanently deleted. Cloud copies remain in your bucket "
"and galleries continue to serve from cloud storage."
msgstr "Lokale filer slettes permanent. Kopierne i skyen bliver i din bucket, og gallerierne leverer fortsat fra cloud-lageret."

